<title>SPAIN: Spain's Tabacalera to buy Max Rohr for $53 mln.</title>
<headline>Spain's Tabacalera to buy Max Rohr for $53 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Tabacalera said on Thursday its unit Tabacalera Cigas International SA would buy the U.S.'s Max Rohr Importer for $53 million.</p>
<p>In a statement, Tabacalera added the contract would be formally concluded by the end of January 1998.</p>
<p>Tabacalara said Max Rohr is one of the most important cigars distributors in the United States.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 8340</p>
